# Per-channel OAuth tokens written by channel_auth.py as tokens/<slug>.json.
# Each one holds a refresh_token AND the client_secret for a real YouTube
# channel - i.e. standing permission to upload as that channel. The rules
# above only ever covered the older single-token filenames, so this directory
# was unignored and one `git add -A` from being published.
